{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2370","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2370","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2370\",\"parent_revision\":\"63a9995ec7d882422acd00534e14b838aea8cf9382a43201854f6620aa5ea8bc\",\"root_revision\":\"63a9995ec7d882422acd00534e14b838aea8cf9382a43201854f6620aa5ea8bc\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nIn `github_sync`, `SECTION_HEADING` (lines 44\u201348) is independently defined and still exported via `__all__` (line 25). It is also used to derive `_HEADING_TO_KEY` and `_KNOWN_SECTION_KEYS`. The values are currently identical to `rendering.SECTION_HEADING`, but maintaining two independent definitions creates a latent divergence risk: a change to one without updating the other would silently produce inconsistent behavior across backends.\\n\\nThe problem: there is no single source of truth for section heading values. The duplicate definition bypasses the canonical `rendering` module and creates a hidden coupling between `github_sync` internal structures and `rendering` output.\\n\\nOut of scope: changing heading values or rendering output.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **refactor: deduplicate section_heading \u2014 remove independent definition from github_sync, use rendering.section_heading as single source** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Quality vigilance concern from #1422 (QG-T1 code review, 2026-04-04)\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-05-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"d7f43438f2298c8fabce8b501fc6742f8a20a98fa079850d637194799f3dd706\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCRVDw\"}"}